WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,890
Since the day Captain Wu rescued me

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:05,930
He keeps talking to me alone. I really don’t know.

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:08,210
He has this intention of pursuing me until tonight

4
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:10,610
Dead without evidence now

5
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:13,530
Even the official investigation team is on my side, Ji Chuan.

6
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:15,440
Let me see how you still touch my team leader

7
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,680
Multiple base members witnessed and confirmed

8
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:20,280
Wu Shen did frequently talk to Su Wanwan alone in the past few days, but no one heard what he talked about.

9
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,920
frequent individual contact

10
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,400
Plus this conclusive recording of a call for help and

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,680
Suizhan caught him on the spot when he was imprisoned.

12
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:31,650
Everything seems to be clear

13
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,570
The captain would never do such a thing

14
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,620
You couple of bitches

15
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:39,820
It must be the captain Sun Tou who was killed by you. Stop fooling around.

16
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,780
You have to talk about evidence

17
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,340
This matter ends here

18
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,580
I will report the contents of the investigation truthfully

19
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:51,860
Everyone must abide by the order of the base and we will be separated tonight, right?

20
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,140
I really didn’t expect that just now

21
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,980
The dignified captain of the second team

22
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:58,340
He actually wanted to bully a newcomer who just arrived.

23
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,260
Fortunately

24
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:01,940
The newcomer was saved by someone with great luck and destiny.
